          "explanation": "Doctor actively requested downstream ED information that led to discovery and integration of objective infection assessment.",
          "quote": "到了之后分诊说了什么、医生看了创面怎么说"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00074",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrated discovered culture and infection-workup context into the plan.",
          "quote": "伤口分泌物培养是要好几天"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
