          "quote": "淡黄、淡血性、量不多、慢慢停住"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00185",
          "explanation": "Doctor defined the dangerous contrasting pattern to reduce false reassurance and false alarm.",
          "quote": "变脓性、味道更冲"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor did not label every wet dressing as infection and did not dismiss risk because fever was not high; instead the plan used exudate quality, odor, expansion, pain trend, systemic state, and temperature monitoring to reduce misclassification.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
