      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00049",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained that low-grade fever plus chills and wound changes still warrants same-day assessment.",
          "quote": "37.8℃加上发冷"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00164",
          "explanation": "Doctor covered multiple systemic red flags requiring immediate action.",
          "quote": "体温感觉明显往上蹿，或者护士量出来超过38.5℃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met through repeated systemic-risk screening and explanation, including chills, temperature, tachycardia, mental status, breathing, and worsening systemic state.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_systemic_red_flags",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00185",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained potentially acceptable post-debridement exudate.",
          "quote": "淡黄、淡血性、量不多、慢慢停住"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00185",
          "explanation": "Doctor explained wound deterioration signs requiring action.",
          "quote": "渗出突然变多、颜色变暗、变绿、变脓性、味道更冲"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met because the doctor elicited and explained wound red flags and clearly distinguished limited expected drainage from worsening, malodorous, purulent, expanding drainage.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_wound_red_flags",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00049",
          "explanation": "Doctor instructed the patient to bring discharge papers and actual medications/materials for reconciliation.",
          "quote": "把你能找到的出院小结、药膏"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00164",
          "explanation": "Doctor clarified that simple topical treatment is not enough for this infected deep-burn scenario.",
          "quote": "靠简单涂抹根本压不住"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: actual medications and paperwork were brought to clinicians, sulfadiazine cream was treated as a wound topical rather than systemic infection treatment, self-application/escalation was prohibited, and systemic antibiotics were left to in-person doctors.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_medication_reconciliation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00049",
          "explanation": "Doctor gave a clear same-day threshold and advised not waiting until the next day.",
          "quote": "不要拖到第二天"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00355",
