          "quote": "不要自己去把纱布全揭开冲洗或乱涂新药膏"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00283",
          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced no self-removal or self-application during inpatient wound observation.",
          "quote": "自己不动纱布、不抹药膏"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met by limiting interim care to keeping the dressing protected, avoiding self-cleansing/debridement or random topical use, and deferring dressing/medication decisions to wound clinicians.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
