          "explanation": "Doctor used the clinical workspace rather than inventing missing history.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00355",
          "explanation": "Doctor directed the patient to verify and document follow-up service, timing, and culture-tracking contact information.",
          "quote": "具体挂哪个科（伤口门诊还是烧伤门诊）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 was met because the doctor used available records/workspace, asked the patient to bring/read discharge materials and medications, and grounded follow-up in burn/wound services with written timing and culture follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_records_and_followup_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00049",
          "explanation": "Doctor addressed distance by allowing a nearer capable hospital rather than insisting on the original remote hospital.",
          "quote": "不一定非要跑回原来那家远的医院"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00120",
          "explanation": "Doctor directly addressed cost/work barriers and prioritized safe treatment.",
          "quote": "费用和请假，让你老婆帮你先跟单位说“急诊住院”"
        }
