          "explanation": "Doctor reinforced the patient's teach-back and tightened the questions/action plan.",
          "quote": "你抓的这两句方向完全对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00369",
          "explanation": "Patient/family demonstrated receipt of follow-up timing, medication restriction, and emergency thresholds.",
